,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700418633,"data":"       | We can analyze equation:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700419778,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700420871,"data":"       | Let s = a + c (positive integer). Then n = s^2.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700422037,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700423125,"data":"       | But also n = a*b + c.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700424267,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700425361,"data":"       | Thus we have:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700426478,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700427568,"data":"       | s^2 = a*b + c.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.70042867,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700429781,"data":"       | Also constraints: 1 ≤ a ≤ b-1, 0 ≤ c ≤ b-1, and s = a + c.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700431118,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700432235,"data":"       | We can treat a and c as unknown digits.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700434653,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700435804,"data":"       | We can rewrite c = s - a. Plug into equation:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700436984,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700438088,"data":"       | s^2 = a*b + (s - a) = a*b + s - a = a*(b - 1) + s.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700439283,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700440368,"data":"       | Thus:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700441485,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700442554,"data":"       | s^2 - s = a*(b - 1).\n"}
