,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.70045883,"data":"       | We also have n = s^2 must be between b and b^2 - 1 (since two-digit representation). Actually n must be at least b (since smallest two-digit number is 1*b + 0 = b) and at most (b-1)*b + (b-1) = b^2 - 1.\n"}
