,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4070.700506918,"data":"       | But note that s(b - s) = s(b-1 - (s-1)) = s(b-1) - s(s-1). Since (b-1) divides s(b-1) trivially, the condition that (b-1) divides s(b - s) is equivalent to (b-1) dividing s(s-1). Because:\n"}
