,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799169373,"data":"       | Given sum = 300, we can compute P in terms of a,b,c.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799170586,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799171641,"data":"       | But perhaps we can reduce to solving for abc.\n"}
