,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799173874,"data":"       | We have formula for sum of squares given sum and product? Not directly.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799175114,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799176213,"data":"       | We can also compute Σ a^2 = (a+b+c)^2 - 2(ab+bc+ca) = 300^2 - 2(ab+bc+ca) = 90,000 - 2(ab+bc+ca).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799177541,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799178638,"data":"       | Thus 90,000 - 2(ab+bc+ca) = 50,000 - abc/50.\n"}
