,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.79918552,"data":"       | Thus ab+bc+ca = 20,000 + (abc)/100.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.79918668,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799187774,"data":"       | Now we have sum S=300, sum of pairwise products T = ab+bc+ca expressed in terms of product.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.79918915,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799190862,"data":"       | We also have P = (a+b)(b+c)(c+a) = (S - a)(S - b)(S - c)?? Wait (a+b) = S - c, etc. Indeed (a+b) = S - c, (b+c) = S - a, (c+a) = S - b.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.79919224,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799193316,"data":"       | Thus P = (S - a)(S - b)(S - c) = (300 - a)(300 - b)(300 - c).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799194524,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799195554,"data":"       | But also P = 6,000,000 + 2abc.\n"}
