,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799197751,"data":"       | Thus (300 - a)(300 - b)(300 - c) = 6,000,000 + 2abc.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799198968,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799200056,"data":"       | Now we have three variables with sum fixed and relation between product and pairwise sum.\n"}
