,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799910778,"data":"       | analysisWe need to count nonnegative integer solutions (a,b,c) to a+b+c=300 and sum_{sym} a^2 b = 6,000,000.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799912084,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799913106,"data":"       | Define S1 = a+b+c = 300.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799914211,"data":"       | Define S2 = ab+bc+ca? Not directly but we have expression: a^2 b + a^2 c + b^2 a + b^2 c + c^2 a + c^2 b = sum_{sym} a^2 b = sum_{cyc} a b (a+b)?? Let's examine.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799915576,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799916724,"data":"       | We can write sum_{sym} a^2 b = a b (a+b) + b c (b+c) + c a (c+a). Indeed each term a^2 b + a b^2 = a b (a+b). So expression = ab(a+b) + bc(b+c) + ca(c+a).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799918003,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799918996,"data":"       | Let’s denote p = a+b+c = 300.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799920103,"data":"       | Let’s denote q = ab+bc+ca.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799921319,"data":"       | Let’s denote r = abc maybe not needed.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799922417,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799923403,"data":"       | Compute ab(a+b) = ab(p - c) = ab p - abc.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799924553,"data":"       | Similarly bc(b+c) = bc(p - a) = bc p - abc.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799925625,"data":"       | Similarly ca(c+a) = ca(p - b) = ca p - abc.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799926722,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799927721,"data":"       | Sum = p (ab+bc+ca) - 3 abc = p q - 3 r.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799928819,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799929808,"data":"       | Thus condition: p q - 3 r = 6,000,000.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799930897,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799944629,"data":"       | Given p = 300, we have 300 q - 3 r = 6,000,000 =\u003e divide by 3: 100 q - r = 2,000,000.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799946129,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799947132,"data":"       | Thus r = 100 q - 2,000,000.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799948224,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799949296,"data":"       | Since a,b,c are nonnegative integers, we need to count triples with sum 300 and product r defined by that equation, but r must equal abc. So we need abc = 100 q - 2,000,000, where q = ab+bc+ca.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799950666,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799951671,"data":"       | Thus we need to find nonnegative integer solutions to a+b+c=300 and abc = 100(ab+bc+ca) - 2,000,000.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799952909,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799953968,"data":"       | We can attempt to solve via enumeration? The range of a,b,c up to 300 each. Number of unordered triples? Could be many but enumeration over all triples (a,b,c) with sum 300 is about C(302,2) = 45,451 combos. That's small; we can brute force compute and count those satisfying condition. Use Python.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799955524,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799956531,"data":"       | But we must be careful about time; 45k loops is trivial.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799957688,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799958704,"data":"       | Let's brute force to see count.assistantanalysis to=python codeimport itertools\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799959894,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799960918,"data":"       | count = 0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799962019,"data":"       | solutions = []\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799963078,"data":"       | for a in range(301):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799964151,"data":"       |     for b in range(301 - a):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799965269,"data":"       |         c = 300 - a - b\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799966344,"data":"       |         # compute expression\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799967736,"data":"       |         expr = a*a*b + a*a*c + b*b*a + b*b*c + c*c*a + c*c*b\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.799968886,"data":"       |         if expr == 6000000:\n"}
