,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.800526458,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.800527487,"data":"       | Observe that a^2 b + a^2 c = a^2 (b+c) = a^2 (S1 - a) = a^2 (300 - a). Similarly for b and c.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.800528704,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.800529701,"data":"       | Thus total expression = Σ a^2 (300 - a) over a,b,c.\n"}
