,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.800540974,"data":"       | Goal: count nonnegative integer solutions to a+b+c=300 with 300 q - r = 6,000,000.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.800542238,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.800543257,"data":"       | We can attempt to express r in terms of a,b,c individually: r = a^3 + b^3 + c^3.\n"}
