,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.800556274,"data":"       | But a - 300 = -(300 - a). So a^2 (a-300) = -a^2 (300 - a) = -a^2 (b + c) (since 300 - a = b + c). Indeed earlier we had a^2 (300 - a) = a^2 (b + c). So a^2 (a-300) = -a^2 (b + c). Sum over cyclic: -[a^2 (b + c) + b^2 (c + a) + c^2 (a + b)] = -6,000,000.\n"}
