,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.801292299,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.801293469,"data":"       | Thus the solution set appears to be all permutations of (a,100,200-a) for a from 0 to 200? Wait a ranges 0..200? Let's check: For a=0 we have (0,100,200). For a=200 we would have (200,100,0). Let's see if (200,100,0) is present.assistantanalysis to=python code(200,100,0) in solutions\n"}
