,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.801966357,"data":"       | ### 3.  Counting the triples\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.801968828,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.801969916,"data":"       | If, say, \\(a=100\\), then \\(b+c=200\\) with \\(b,c\\ge 0\\).  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.801971242,"data":"       | There are \\(201\\) possibilities for \\((b,c)\\) \\((b=0,1,\\dots ,200)\\).\n"}
