,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.801973584,"data":"       | The same count holds when \\(b=100\\) or \\(c=100\\).  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4109.8019748,"data":"       | Hence the sum of the three single‑variable counts is \\(3\\cdot201\\).\n"}
