,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4137.331556468,"data":"       | Define left interval: positions 1..(i-2) (since i-1 is excluded). Right interval: positions (i+3)..10 (since i+2 excluded). If i-2 \u003c 1, left interval empty; if i+3 \u003e 10, right interval empty.\n"}
