,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4137.332250588,"data":"       | and call a subset \\(A\\subseteq S\\) *good* if it contains **exactly one** pair of consecutive integers.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4137.332251961,"data":"       | If a good set contains the pair \\(\\{i,i+1\\}\\) then no other two elements of the set may be consecutive.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4137.332253315,"data":"       | \n"}
