,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4137.332291283,"data":"       | ### 3.  Subsets with no consecutive numbers in a block  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4137.332292434,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4137.332293585,"data":"       | For a block of length \\(L\\) the number of subsets that contain **no**\n"}
