,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4137.332362179,"data":"       | We need Fibonacci numbers up to F_9 maybe. Let's compute: Using standard Fibonacci with F_0=0, F_1=1, F_2=1, F_3=2, F_4=3, F_5=5, F_6=8, F_7=13, F_8=21, F_9=34, F_10=55.\n"}
