,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4137.332700924,"data":"       | Now we need to present reasoning.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4137.332702009,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4137.332703079,"data":"       | We can also derive using combinatorial arguments: Choose the unique pair's position; then treat the remaining numbers as a set with no consecutive numbers, etc. Use Fibonacci numbers.\n"}
