,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4191.57800063,"data":"       | analysisWe need to solve: two positive integers a,b \u003c100, gcd(a,b)=3. Their lcm = 12 * one of the integers (i.e., lcm = 12*a or 12*b). Need largest possible sum a+b.\n"}
