,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4191.57801209,"data":"       | Condition: lcm = 12 * one of the integers. So either 3xy = 12 * a = 12 * 3x = 36x, or 3xy = 12 * b = 12 * 3y = 36y.\n"}
