,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4191.578321346,"data":"       | Now lcm(a,b) = 3 * lcm(x,y) *? Wait lcm(a,b) = (a*b)/gcd(a,b) = (3x * 3y)/3 = 3xy. But also lcm = 12 * one of the integers. So either lcm = 12*a or lcm = 12*b. Since a,b positive, lcm must be at least each integer. Let's test both possibilities.\n"}
