,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.830893582,"data":"       | We have system:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.830894606,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.830895615,"data":"       | y^x = x^{10}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.830896656,"data":"       | x^{4y} = y^{10}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.83089768,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.830898699,"data":"       | We need positive real solutions \u003e1.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.830899802,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.830900832,"data":"       | Take logs: x ln y = 10 ln x (1')\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.830901919,"data":"       | 4y ln x = 10 ln y (2')\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.830902938,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.830903968,"data":"       | Let’s denote a = ln x \u003e0, b = ln y \u003e0. Then x = e^a, y = e^b.\n"}
