,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.83090932,"data":"       | (1'): x ln y = e^a * b = 10 a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.830910396,"data":"       | (2'): 4y ln x = 4 e^b * a = 10 b\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.830913168,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.83091422,"data":"       | So we have:\n"}
