,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.83091624,"data":"       | e^a * b = 10 a   (I)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.830917388,"data":"       | 4 e^b * a = 10 b   (II)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.830918445,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.830919476,"data":"       | We need to solve for a,b \u003e0.\n"}
