,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832076549,"data":"       | Plug into (B):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832077565,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832078596,"data":"       | 4 a e^b = 10 b = 10 * (10 a / e^a) = 100 a / e^a.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832079702,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832080729,"data":"       | Cancel a (nonzero). So:\n"}
