,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832220812,"data":"       | Thus xy = 25 exactly? Let's see if we can prove exactly.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832221982,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832223022,"data":"       | From earlier we derived e^{a+b}=25 using algebraic steps that didn't assume any approximations. Let's verify.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832224242,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832225272,"data":"       | We had:\n"}
