,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832229482,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832230506,"data":"       | From (A): b = 10 a / e^a.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832231576,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832232595,"data":"       | Plug into (B): 4 a e^{b} = 10 * (10 a / e^a) =\u003e 4 a e^b = 100 a / e^a.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832233758,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832234765,"data":"       | Divide both sides by a (nonzero): 4 e^b = 100 / e^a.\n"}
