,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832240829,"data":"       | Multiply both sides by e^a: e^{a+b} = 25.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832241939,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832243061,"data":"       | Thus xy = e^{a+b} = 25 exactly. No approximations needed.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832244182,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832245206,"data":"       | Thus answer is 25.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832246229,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832247269,"data":"       | But we must ensure that x\u003e1 and y\u003e1 are indeed satisfied. Since a,b\u003e0 (ln \u003e0). Let's check positivity.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832248602,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832249661,"data":"       | From derived product, we still need to confirm there exists solution with a,b positive.\n"}
