,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832812086,"data":"       | Interpret logs: log base a of b = ln b / ln a.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832813208,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832814219,"data":"       | Equation 1: log_x(y^x) = 10 =\u003e ln(y^x) / ln x = 10 =\u003e (x * ln y) / ln x = 10.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832815472,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832816591,"data":"       | Equation 2: log_y(x^{4y}) = 10 =\u003e ln(x^{4y}) / ln y = 10 =\u003e (4y * ln x) / ln y = 10.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832817871,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832819109,"data":"       | We have two equations:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832820178,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832821282,"data":"       | (1) x * ln y = 10 * ln x.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832822361,"data":"       | (2) 4y * ln x = 10 * ln y.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832823422,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832824428,"data":"       | We can treat unknowns x\u003e1, y\u003e1.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832825705,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832826772,"data":"       | Let’s denote a = ln x, b = ln y. Then x = e^a, y = e^b. Since x\u003e1, a\u003e0; similarly b\u003e0.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832828092,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832829074,"data":"       | Then equations become:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832830219,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832831231,"data":"       | (1) e^a * b = 10 * a.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832832319,"data":"       | (2) 4 e^b * a = 10 * b.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832833338,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832834445,"data":"       | We need xy = e^{a+b}.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832835462,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832836472,"data":"       | So we need to solve for a,b \u003e0 satisfying:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832837619,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832838618,"data":"       | b e^a = 10 a   (Eq A)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832839912,"data":"       | 4 a e^b = 10 b   (Eq B)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832842682,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832843714,"data":"       | We can try solving analytically.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832844796,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832845811,"data":"       | From Eq A: b = 10 a / e^a.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832846877,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832847877,"data":"       | Plug into Eq B: 4 a e^{b} = 10 b.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832848952,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832849989,"data":"       | But b expressed in terms of a; also b appears in exponent e^b. So we have:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832851167,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832852165,"data":"       | 4 a e^{b} = 10 * (10 a / e^a) = (100 a) / e^a.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832853255,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832854272,"data":"       | Divide both sides by a (a\u003e0): 4 e^{b} = 100 / e^a =\u003e e^{b} = 25 / e^a.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832855479,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832856472,"data":"       | Thus:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832857488,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832858518,"data":"       | e^{b} = 25 e^{-a} =\u003e b = ln 25 - a.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832859606,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832860622,"data":"       | But we also have b = 10 a / e^a.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832861684,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832862689,"data":"       | Thus we have equation:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832863726,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832864735,"data":"       | ln 25 - a = 10 a / e^a.\n"}
