,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832866819,"data":"       | Goal: solve for a\u003e0.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832867892,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4263.832868912,"data":"       | Let’s denote function f(a) = ln 25 - a - 10 a / e^a = 0.\n"}
