,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707442646,"data":"       | (1-x)^{2}f(1-x)+f(x)=-(1-x)^{4}+2(1-x).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707443802,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707444875,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707445936,"data":"       | Thus for each \\(x\\) we have the linear system  \n"}
