,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707670669,"data":"       | analysisWe have functional equation: x^2 f(x) + f(1 - x) = -x^4 + 2x for all real x.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707672102,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707673178,"data":"       | We need to determine f(x) uniquely for all x except at two points α and β where not determined. Compute α^2 + β^2.\n"}
