,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.70767582,"data":"       | Essentially we have linear functional equation linking values at x and 1-x. Solve for f(x) in terms of f(1-x). Write equation (1). Also plug x -\u003e 1 - x to get second equation: (1 - x)^2 f(1 - x) + f(x) = -(1 - x)^4 + 2(1 - x). Then we have system of two linear equations in unknowns f(x) and f(1 - x). Solve for f(x) unless determinant zero. Determinant = x^2 * 1 - (1 - x)^2 * 1? Wait coefficients: first equation: x^2 * f(x) + 1 * f(1 - x) = RHS1. Second: 1 * f(x) + (1 - x)^2 * f(1 - x) = RHS2 (where RHS2 = -(1 - x)^4 + 2(1 - x)). Write system:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707679969,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707681066,"data":"       | [ x^2   1 ] [f(x)] = [R1]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707682327,"data":"       | [ 1   (1 - x)^2] [f(1 - x)] = [R2]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707683476,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707684668,"data":"       | Solve linear system: determinant D = x^2 * (1 - x)^2 - 1*1 = (x(1 - x))^2 - 1.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707685898,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707687086,"data":"       | If D ≠ 0, we can solve uniquely. If D = 0, system may be dependent or inconsistent, leading to undetermined values. So α,β correspond to x values where D = 0? Let's compute.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707688574,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707689713,"data":"       | Set D = (x(1 - x))^2 - 1 = 0 =\u003e (x(1 - x))^2 = 1 =\u003e |x(1 - x)| = 1. So x(1 - x) = 1 or -1.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707691083,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.70769252,"data":"       | Solve quadratic: x - x^2 = 1 =\u003e -x^2 + x - 1 = 0 =\u003e x^2 - x + 1 = 0 =\u003e discriminant Δ = (-1)^2 - 4*1*1 = 1 - 4 = -3 \u003c0 =\u003e no real solutions.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707705262,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707706554,"data":"       | Now x - x^2 = -1 =\u003e -x^2 + x + 1 = 0 =\u003e x^2 - x - 1 = 0 =\u003e solutions: x = [1 ± sqrt(1 + 4)]/2 = [1 ± sqrt5]/2. Both real.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4291.707708043,"data":"       | \n"}
