,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.021236089,"data":"       | P(-1) = (-1)^3 + p (-1)^2 + q (-1) + r = -1 + p - q + r = -1 (given). So equation: -1 + p - q + r = -1 =\u003e p - q + r = 0. (Eq1)\n"}
