,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.022254779,"data":"       | x*y*z = 1. (Equation for shift 1)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.022257481,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.022258618,"data":"       | Now (a+2) = (x-1+2) = x+1. So (a+2) = x+1, similarly (b+2) = y+1, (c+2) = z+1.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.022259844,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.022260943,"data":"       | Thus (x+1)(y+1)(z+1) = 2.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.0222621,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.022263189,"data":"       | Similarly (a+3) = x+2, etc. So (x+2)(y+2)(z+2) = 3.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.022264402,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.022265473,"data":"       | We need (a+4) = x+3, so product (x+3)(y+3)(z+3) = ?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.02226667,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.022267787,"data":"       | Thus we have three unknowns x,y,z satisfying:\n"}
