,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.022285873,"data":"       | Indeed, (x + k)(y + k)(z + k) = xyz + k(xy + yz + zx) + k^2 (x + y + z) + k^3 = s3 + k s2 + k^2 s1 + k^3.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.022287147,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.022288216,"data":"       | Check: Expand: (x + k)(y + k)(z + k) = xyz + k(xy + yz + zx) + k^2(x + y + z) + k^3.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.022289445,"data":"       | \n"}
