,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4348.022299512,"data":"       | Thus equation: 1 + s2 + s1 + 1 = 2? Wait compute: s3 = 1, k=1 =\u003e s3 + 1*s2 + 1^2*s1 + 1^3 = 1 + s2 + s1 + 1 = s2 + s1 + 2 = 2 =\u003e s2 + s1 = 0.\n"}
